msgid "精确支持范围"
msgstr "Exact support scope"

msgid ""
"[派生能力矩阵](capabilities.md) 自动核对 SoC/route 的 mode、参考 Board binding 与实际 "
"resolver/emitter 选择的生产源码。叙述表说明运行合同，派生表说明精确 身份与有限源码一致性；两者均不继承旧 HEAD "
"的资格或替代实板执行。 本轮有限芯片接入与平台反馈流程见 [主流 MCU 接入](../design/mainstream-mcu-"
"adaptation.md)；同系列其他型号、封装和模式 不能自动继承本页范围。"
msgstr ""
"The [derived capability matrix](capabilities.md) automatically checks "
"SoC/route modes, reference Board bindings and production sources selected by"
" the actual resolver/emitter. Narrative tables describe runtime contracts; "
"derived tables describe exact identities and bounded source consistency. "
"Neither inherits old-HEAD qualification nor replaces physical execution. See"
" [mainstream MCU adaptation](../design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md) for "
"this increment and its platform feedback process. Other parts, packages and "
"modes in the same family do not automatically inherit this scope."

msgid "芯片、板卡与系统"
msgstr "Chips, Boards and systems"

msgid "目标"
msgstr "Target"

msgid "软件实现"
msgstr "Software implementation"

msgid "未完成的物理事实"
msgstr "Unfinished physical facts"

msgid "STM32F407ZGT6 / 启明欣欣 V3.1"
msgstr "STM32F407ZGT6 / Qiming Xinxin V3.1"

msgid ""
"Cortex-M4F；1 MiB Flash；主 SRAM 128 KiB、CCM 64 KiB；声明 clock/profile 与 reviewed"
" routes"
msgstr ""
"Cortex-M4F; 1 MiB Flash; main SRAM 128 KiB, CCM 64 KiB; declared "
"clock/profile and reviewed routes"

msgid "实际 PCB 修订、晶振、供电、连续性、波形与负载"
msgstr "Actual PCB revision, crystal, power, continuity, waveforms and loads"

msgid "STM32F407VET6 / 天空星青春版"
msgstr "STM32F407VET6 / Sky Star Youth Edition"

msgid "Cortex-M4F；512 KiB Flash；主 SRAM 128 KiB、CCM 64 KiB；独立 Board 资源"
msgstr ""
"Cortex-M4F; 512 KiB Flash; main SRAM 128 KiB, CCM 64 KiB; independent Board "
"resources"

msgid "相同类别的实际 PCB／电气／HIL 验收"
msgstr "Corresponding actual PCB/electrical/HIL acceptance"

msgid "GD32F470ZGT6 / 梁山派"
msgstr "GD32F470ZGT6 / Liangshan Pi"

msgid ""
"Cortex-M4F；1 MiB Flash；主 SRAM 192 KiB、ADDSRAM 256 KiB、TCM 64 KiB；25 MHz "
"声明输入、200 MHz profile；可选 USB 独立 48 MHz owner"
msgstr ""
"Cortex-M4F; 1 MiB Flash; main SRAM 192 KiB, ADDSRAM 256 KiB, TCM 64 KiB; "
"declared 25 MHz input, 200 MHz profile; optional independent 48 MHz USB "
"owner"

msgid "未观察 PCB/晶振/电气；默认 linker 只用主 SRAM；实际 USB clock/PHY 仍未测量"
msgstr ""
"PCB/crystal/electrical facts unobserved; default linker uses main SRAM only;"
" actual USB clock/PHY unmeasured"

msgid "STM32G474RET6 / MB1367 来源参考配置"
msgstr "STM32G474RET6 / MB1367 source-reference configuration"

msgid ""
"Cortex-M4F；512 KiB Flash；SRAM1/2 96 KiB 与单独计数的 CCM 32 KiB；HSE24/170 "
"MHz、TIM2；封装 GPIO、六 UART IRQ bytes、SPI1/2 轮询、TIM3/4 CH1 "
"PWM、IWDG、EXTI0/1；独立软件夹具增加 ADC1 单次／有限 TIM6-DMA block、I2C1 polling 与物理 "
"Flash；裸机／FreeRTOS 静态 factory"
msgstr ""
"Cortex-M4F; 512 KiB Flash; 96 KiB SRAM1/2 and separately counted 32 KiB CCM;"
" HSE24/170 MHz, TIM2; package GPIO, six IRQ-byte UARTs, polling SPI1/2, "
"TIM3/4 CH1 PWM, IWDG and EXTI0/1; separate software fixtures add ADC1 "
"shots/finite TIM6 DMA blocks, polling I2C1 and physical Flash; "
"baremetal/FreeRTOS static factory"

msgid ""
"52 个封装 GPIO 不等于 PCB 接线；PF0/PF1、PG10 保留；ADC DMA 仅选 SRAM1/2，不开放 CCM alias；无 "
"UART/SPI DMA、连续 ADC 或自动 AF 选择；PCB／电气／HIL 未观察"
msgstr ""
"The 52 package GPIO pads do not establish PCB wiring; PF0/PF1 and PG10 "
"remain reserved; ADC DMA selects SRAM1/2 only and excludes CCM aliases; no "
"UART/SPI DMA, continuous ADC or automatic AF selection; PCB/electrical/HIL "
"behavior unobserved"

msgid "STM32H743ZIT6 / NUCLEO-H743ZI2 来源参考配置"
msgstr "STM32H743ZIT6 / NUCLEO-H743ZI2 source-reference configuration"

msgid "STM32U575ZIT6Q / NUCLEO-U575ZI-Q 单状态参考配置"
msgstr "STM32U575ZIT6Q / NUCLEO-U575ZI-Q single-state reference configuration"

msgid "STM32U575 独立 TZEN=1 双域参考"
msgstr "Independent STM32U575 TZEN=1 split-domain reference"

msgid ""
"外部预先配置 option bytes；两个 Runtime 镜像、冷启动 SAU／MPU／SRAM 归属 owner、真实 CMSE SG；单一非特权"
" NonSecure Thread 通过同步复制消息访问受限 PC7 GPIO"
msgstr ""
"Externally preconfigured option bytes; two Runtime images, cold "
"SAU/MPU/SRAM-attribution owner, actual CMSE SG; one unprivileged NonSecure "
"Thread accesses restricted PC7 GPIO through synchronously copied messages"

msgid ""
"未执行实板隔离验收；无 OS、通用双域 factory、NS 任务身份、异步借用／跨域 DMA 或产品镜像认证；不改变上列 TZEN=0 默认装配"
msgstr ""
"No physical-isolation acceptance; no OS, generic split-domain factory, NS "
"task identity, asynchronous borrow/cross-domain DMA or product-image "
"authentication; does not change default TZEN=0 assembly above"

msgid "STM32F103RBT6 / NUCLEO-F103RB 来源参考配置"
msgstr "STM32F103RBT6 / NUCLEO-F103RB source reference"

msgid ""
"Cortex-M3，无 FPU；128 KiB Flash、20 KiB SRAM；HSI8、16-bit TIM2；GPIO、USART2 IRQ "
"bytes／有限 DMA TX／duplex RX blocks、SPI1 polling、I2C1 IRQ 消息、PA0 ADC1、PA6 TIM3 "
"CH1 PWM、EXTI0/1、IWDG 与物理 Flash；裸机／FreeRTOS 静态装配"
msgstr ""
"Cortex-M3 without FPU; 128 KiB Flash, 20 KiB SRAM; HSI8 and 16-bit TIM2; "
"GPIO, USART2 IRQ bytes/finite DMA TX/duplex RX blocks, polling SPI1, I2C1 "
"IRQ messages, PA0 ADC1, PA6 TIM3 CH1 PWM, EXTI0/1, IWDG and physical Flash; "
"baremetal/FreeRTOS static assembly"

msgid ""
"正常启动仅核工厂 Flash 密度 128 KiB；ES096 2.2.2 限制正常固件读取 "
"DBGMCU，设备组／修订未观察，料号／封装为配置声明；PCB／VCP 焊桥／引脚负载／HSI 精度未观察；PA5 LED/SPI 与 PA6 "
"SPI/PWM 冲突须拒绝；I2C priority0 不调用内核；RX 有间隙；无 SPI/I2C DMA 或其他 F1 型号支持"
msgstr ""
"Normal startup checks only the 128 KiB factory Flash density; ES096 2.2.2 "
"prevents ordinary firmware from observing DBGMCU, so device group/revision "
"remain unobserved and part/package are configuration declarations; PCB, VCP "
"bridges, pin loads and HSI accuracy unobserved; PA5 LED/SPI and PA6 SPI/PWM "
"conflicts must reject; priority-zero I2C cannot call a kernel; RX has gaps; "
"no SPI/I2C DMA or support for other F1 parts"

msgid "GD32F303RCT6 / 芯片软件参考"
msgstr "GD32F303RCT6 / chip software reference"

msgid ""
"Cortex-M4F；256 KiB Flash、48 KiB SRAM；IRC8M、TIMER1/TIMER4 硬件级联时间域；GPIO、USART0"
" IRQ bytes／有限 DMA TX／duplex RX blocks、SPI0 polling、I2C0 IRQ 消息、PA0 ADC0、PA6 "
"TIMER2 CH0 PWM、EXTI0/1、FWDGT 与物理 FMC；裸机／FreeRTOS 静态装配"
msgstr ""
"Cortex-M4F; 256 KiB Flash, 48 KiB SRAM; IRC8M and TIMER1/TIMER4 hardware-"
"cascaded time; GPIO, USART0 IRQ bytes/finite DMA TX/duplex RX blocks, "
"polling SPI0, I2C0 IRQ messages, PA0 ADC0, PA6 TIMER2 CH0 PWM, EXTI0/1, "
"FWDGT and physical FMC; baremetal/FreeRTOS static assembly"

msgid ""
"无已审 PCB、LED、晶振、串口适配器或 connector 接线；I2C priority0 不调用内核；RX 有间隙；无 SPI/I2C DMA "
"或其他 F30x 型号支持；级联传播及电气须实测"
msgstr ""
"No reviewed PCB, LED, crystal, UART adapter or connector wiring; priority-"
"zero I2C cannot call a kernel; RX has gaps; no SPI/I2C DMA or support for "
"other F30x parts; cascade propagation and electrical behavior require "
"physical measurement"

msgid "Native"
msgstr "Native"

msgid "Linux/POSIX 行为模型、实际线程与持久化文件故障模型"
msgstr ""
"Linux/POSIX behavior model with actual threads/persistent-file fault models"

msgid "不构成 MCU 或电气资格"
msgstr "No MCU or electrical qualification"

msgid ""
"裸机和锁定 FreeRTOS 均为显式选择的薄适配。启动只建立平台时钟／接口，不创建 scheduler、产品任务或工作流。FreeRTOS POSIX"
" host 运行验证软件生命周期，不能 替代对应 MCU 的 IRQ ceiling、FPU context 与 stack high-water "
"实板验证。"
msgstr ""
"Baremetal/pinned FreeRTOS are explicitly selected thin adapters. Startup "
"establishes platform clocks/interfaces only, without schedulers, product "
"tasks or workflows. FreeRTOS POSIX host execution verifies software "
"lifecycle, not MCU IRQ ceilings, FPU context or physical stack high-water."

msgid ""
"H743 使用官方 Cortex-M7 启动与有界 LDO 电源入口，在 ACTVOSRDY 前禁止 RAM 写入；从 HSI64、Cache off "
"的可信冷状态建立所选固定时钟与 Cache 配置。Cache 关闭位本身不能证明外来 dirty 数据已经清理；要求可信复位或此前成功完成自有 "
"clean/disable。U575 默认 Platform 使用官方 Cortex-M33 启动并维护 TZEN=0 单地址状态；独立 TZEN=1 "
"参考有自己的入口和安全归属 owner。启动后读取 option register 不能使不匹配的启动变成合法状态。两者都不修改 option "
"bytes，不自动 接管 bootloader、DMA 或既有 clock/IRQ owner。原始 CMSIS Device H7/U5 源码、 "
"许可和版本固定在 source lock。 精确入口见 [H743](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md) 与 "
"[U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/README.md)。"
msgstr ""
"H743 uses official Cortex-M7 startup/bounded LDO entry and forbids RAM "
"writes before ACTVOSRDY, establishing selected clocks/Cache from trusted "
"HSI64/Cache-off cold state. Disabled Cache bits do not prove foreign dirty "
"data clean; trusted reset/prior successful owned clean-disable is required. "
"Default U575 Platform uses official Cortex-M33 startup/TZEN=0 single-address"
" state. Independent TZEN=1 has separate entry/security owner. Reading option"
" registers after startup cannot legalize incompatible startup. Neither "
"changes option bytes or automatically takes over bootloaders, DMA or "
"existing clock/IRQ owners. Original CMSIS Device H7/U5 "
"bytes/licenses/versions are source-locked. Entries: "
"[H743](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md), [U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/README.md)."

msgid ""
"ThreadX 是额外显式后端，锁定官方 Eclipse ThreadX 6.5.2.202603 release。当前 配置维护三块 "
"F407/F470 Board 的 Cortex-M4 GNU port，以及 Native Linux GNU。 独立 CPU runtime 维护 "
"M4 integer、M4F hard/softfp，BASEPRI 或 PRIMASK 政策； 其他 Cortex-M ThreadX port "
"明确拒绝。生产 graph、真实 Linux 内核 task/queue/join 与三板 ARM 链接分别验证，Linux 自身 pthread "
"栈与内部 host 分配不是 MCU 成本。 ThreadX 不实现本项目 FreeRTOS 的 MPU、split-security 或 "
"tickless 模式。详见 [ThreadX 接入](../design/threadx.md)。平台启动不进入任何内核，产品显式进入内核； 仍运行的"
" scheduler 不允许普通 I/O shutdown 关闭其 clock/Tick。"
msgstr ""
"ThreadX is an additional explicit backend pinned to official Eclipse ThreadX"
" 6.5.2.202603. Configuration maintains Cortex-M4 GNU on three F407/F470 "
"Boards and Native Linux GNU. Independent CPU runtime maintains M4 "
"integer/M4F hard-softfp with BASEPRI/PRIMASK policies; other Cortex-M "
"ThreadX ports reject. Production graphs, actual Linux task/queue/join and "
"three-board ARM links are verified separately. Linux pthread stacks/internal"
" host allocations are not MCU cost. ThreadX implements none of this "
"project's FreeRTOS MPU/split-security/tickless modes. See "
"[ThreadX](../design/threadx.md). Platform start enters no kernel; products "
"enter explicitly. Running schedulers cannot lose clock/Tick through ordinary"
" I/O shutdown."

msgid ""
"CPU 软件层另支持 M0／M0+／M3／M4／M7／M23／M33／M55／M85，统一严格事实 解析器选择 "
"Core/Arch、原子操作和裸机/FreeRTOS runtime。M0/M0+ RMW 使用 bounded saved-PRIMASK；可选 "
"cache/MPU/SAU 有真实 CPU 算法，FPU/MVE 与安全 状态决定精确 kernel port 和 ABI。CPU-only "
"runtime 自身不生成 SoC/Board/factory； 上述 H743/U575 纵切片分别拥有独立装配与验收。编译、寄存器模型与真实 "
"FP/MVE/cache/MPU/安全世界验收分别记录； `cache.h` 的范围维护与仅 M7 维护的冷 Cache 启停分别提供；CMSE "
"范围权限观察 本身不建立用户内存 pin、复制或 transport。 可选 restricted MPU task 和 split "
"Secure/NonSecure runtime 已有独立软件实现； 窄 delay/tick SVC、Secure context lease "
"与调用者静态存储分别验证。默认仍为 privileged single-world；MPU+split 明确拒绝，未新增实板 HIL。范围和配置例子见 "
"[Cortex-M 软件支持](cortex-m.md) 与 [Arch 契约](../design/arch-contracts.md)。"
msgstr ""
"CPU software additionally supports M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85. One "
"strict fact parser selects Core/Arch/atomics/baremetal-FreeRTOS runtime. "
"M0/M0+ RMW uses bounded saved-PRIMASK. Optional cache/MPU/SAU execute real "
"CPU algorithms; FPU/MVE/security choose exact kernel ports/ABI. CPU-only "
"runtime generates no SoC/Board/factory. H743/U575 slices separately own "
"assembly/acceptance. Compilation, register models and actual "
"FP/MVE/cache/MPU/security-world acceptance are recorded separately. "
"`cache.h` range maintenance and M7-only cold control are separate; CMSE "
"permission observation alone provides no user-memory pin/copy/transport. "
"Restricted-MPU-task/split Secure-NonSecure runtime have independent software"
" implementations with separately verified narrow delay/tick SVC, Secure-"
"context leases and caller static storage. Default remains privileged single-"
"world; MPU+split rejects; no physical HIL added. See [Cortex-M](cortex-m.md)"
" and [Arch contracts](../design/arch-contracts.md)."

msgid "首发模式"
msgstr "Launch modes"

msgid ""
"以下完整外设表只对应 F407/F470 首发实现。F103、GD303、G474、H743、U575 仅维护上表与各 SoC "
"合同明确列出的切片，不继承这张完整 I/O 表。U575 双域同步 GPIO 参考单独维护；不从芯片型号或通用接口推断其他外设、DMA、ThreadX "
"或低功耗模式。"
msgstr ""
"The complete peripheral table below applies only to the initial F407/F470 "
"implementation. F103, GD303, G474, H743 and U575 maintain only the slices "
"explicitly listed above and in their SoC contracts; they do not inherit this"
" complete I/O table. The U575 dual-world synchronous GPIO reference is "
"maintained separately. Chip names or generic interfaces do not imply "
"additional peripherals, DMA, ThreadX or low-power modes."

msgid "接口"
msgstr "Interface"

msgid "已实现模式与限制"
msgstr "Implemented modes and limits"

msgid "GPIO"
msgstr "GPIO"

msgid "authorized mask、原子 set/reset、快照 read、single-writer toggle"
msgstr ""
"Authorized mask, atomic set/reset, snapshot read and single-writer toggle"

msgid "UART"
msgstr "UART"

msgid ""
"8N1 IRQ TX 或有限 TX DMA；caller-owned request、真实 TC；IRQ RX blocks／IDLE、有限及连续 RX"
" DMA、双向 DMA；显式 RTS/CTS 与外部静态 RS485 适配；STM baud 最低 1282、GD 最低 1526，最高 1 Mbaud"
msgstr ""
"8N1 IRQ TX or bounded TX DMA; caller-owned requests, actual TC; IRQ RX "
"blocks/IDLE, bounded/continuous RX DMA and duplex DMA; explicit "
"RTS/CTS/external static RS485 adapter; STM minimum baud 1282, GD minimum "
"1526, maximum 1 Mbaud"

msgid "SPI"
msgstr "SPI"

msgid ""
"8-bit MSB-first；短轮询每笔最多 256 bytes；有限 DMA 最多 65535 bytes；双向递增或调用者单字节固定 "
"dummy/discard；单 wire-active、完整 CS interval；独立 CS endpoint"
msgstr ""
"8-bit MSB-first; short polling ≤256 bytes/transaction; bounded DMA ≤65535 "
"bytes; incrementing bidirectional spans or caller one-byte fixed "
"dummy/discard; one wire-active operation, complete CS interval, separate CS "
"endpoints"

msgid "I2C"
msgstr "I2C"

msgid ""
"100 kHz；最多 8 条消息、每条 read/write 1–256 bytes；轮询、中断及 DMA 消息；1/2/末三字节 "
"ACK、repeated START/NACK/仲裁/STOP；恢复检查 BUSY 与所选 SCL/SDA 电平；独立有界 GPIO bus-clear"
" 工具"
msgstr ""
"100 kHz; ≤8 messages, read/write 1–256 bytes each; polling/IRQ/DMA messages;"
" 1/2/final-three-byte ACK, repeated START/NACK/arbitration/STOP; recovery "
"checks BUSY/selected SCL-SDA levels; separate bounded GPIO bus-clear tool"

msgid "Flash"
msgstr "Flash"

msgid ""
"STM 精确 16/64/128 KiB sector 几何与 x32 program（4-byte alignment/length，声明供电 "
"2.7–3.6 V）；GD 官方独立 4 KiB page erase 与 halfword program；全物理空间、外部受限 region"
msgstr ""
"STM exact 16/64/128 KiB sectors and x32 program (4-byte alignment/length, "
"declared 2.7–3.6 V); GD official independent 4 KiB page erase/halfword "
"program; complete physical space with external restricted regions"

msgid "Watchdog"
msgstr "Watchdog"

msgid ""
"独立 enable/feed/reset cause；名义配置成功返回 SUCCESS，启用不可逆，启用后的失败保留责任；F407 和 GD470 "
"当前物理 timeout bounds 均为 `0/0 unknown`，已启用 state 查询返回 UNSUPPORTED 并保留 "
"enabled／irreversible／实际 debug 事实；失败的启用前 LSI／debug 清理可经平台 stop 重试"
msgstr ""
"Independent enable/feed/reset cause; successful nominal programming returns "
"SUCCESS, activation is irreversible and failures after activation retain "
"responsibility; F407 and GD470 currently report physical timeout bounds as "
"`0/0 unknown`; an enabled state query returns UNSUPPORTED while preserving "
"enabled, irreversible and actual debug facts; failed preactivation LSI/debug"
" cleanup can be retried through Platform stop"

msgid "EXTI"
msgstr "EXTI"

msgid ""
"selected line、共享 vector、caller-sized event queue、丢失／coalescing 可见；无 debounce"
" 政策"
msgstr ""
"Selected lines, shared vectors, caller-sized event queues, visible "
"loss/coalescing; no debounce policy"

msgid "PWM"
msgstr "PWM"

msgid ""
"固定 timer/channel/base、CCR shadow、0/100%、safe inactive；公共 stop 可以 restart，平台 "
"teardown 释放 owner"
msgstr ""
"Fixed timer/channel/base, CCR shadow, 0/100%, safe inactive; public stop "
"permits restart, platform teardown releases owner"

msgid "ADC"
msgstr "ADC"

msgid ""
"reviewed channel、single-shot/低速 scan、有限及连续双缓冲定时触发 DMA blocks；显式 sample "
"time/reference；只发布完整扫描；可选外部序列与软件观测时间记录"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed channels, single-shot/low-rate scan, bounded/continuous double-"
"buffer timer-triggered DMA blocks; explicit sample time/reference; complete "
"scans only; optional external sequences/software observation timestamps"

msgid "Classic CAN"
msgstr "Classic CAN"

msgid ""
"11/29-bit DATA/RTR、0–8 bytes、真实三邮箱、共享 filter domain、显式 abort/bus-off "
"recovery；没有 CAN FD 或自动重发"
msgstr ""
"11/29-bit DATA/RTR, 0–8 bytes, three real mailboxes/shared filter domain, "
"explicit abort/bus-off recovery; no CAN FD/automatic retransmission"

msgid "USB FS device"
msgstr "USB FS device"

msgid ""
"F407 名义周期使用 `(RLR + 1) × divisor / 32000`，GD470 使用 `(RLD × divisor + 1) / "
"32000`，不能套用同一公式。F407 数据手册的 17..47 kHz 是 VDD=3 V、TA=-40..105 °C "
"的表征条件，当前没有声明满足条件的 operating profile； GD470 数据手册只给 IRC32K 典型频率，没有已审查的保证 "
"Min/Max。因此两者当前均报告 未知物理边界。SUCCESS 表示名义寄存器配置完成，不证明物理超时；启用后的 UNSUPPORTED "
"查询也不表示计数器已关闭。需要保证时限的产品必须在不可逆启用前 拒绝不满足其时限合同的 profile。"
msgstr ""
"F407 uses nominal period `(RLR + 1) × divisor / 32000`, while GD470 uses "
"`(RLD × divisor + 1) / 32000`; the formulas are not interchangeable. The "
"F407 datasheet characterizes 17..47 kHz at VDD=3 V and TA=-40..105 °C; no "
"current operating profile declares these conditions. The GD470 datasheet "
"provides only the typical IRC32K frequency, without a reviewed guaranteed "
"Min/Max. Both therefore report unknown physical bounds. SUCCESS means "
"nominal register programming completed, not that a physical timeout was "
"proved. An UNSUPPORTED query after activation does not mean the counter is "
"disabled. Products requiring guaranteed timing must reject profiles that do "
"not satisfy their timing contract before irreversible activation."

msgid ""
"USB 配置/factory 已在两 STM 封装与 GD470 的软件 Board 夹具执行真实 ARM 链接， 默认参考 Board 不自动暴露 "
"USB connector/VBUS 电气。`vbus_sensing=true` 缺少 reviewed 电气时拒绝。PA11/PA12 AF10 "
"的硅片路线不证明实际跳帽、供电、VBUS 或 ESD；它与 CAN1/USART1 flow-control 的资源冲突必须拒绝。详见 [USB "
"packet 合同](../design/usb-device.md)。"
msgstr ""
"USB configuration/factory actually ARM-links on software-Board fixtures for "
"both STM packages/GD470. Default reference Boards expose no automatic USB "
"connector/VBUS electrical facts. `vbus_sensing=true` rejects absent reviewed"
" electrical facts. PA11/PA12 AF10 silicon routes prove no actual "
"jumpers/power/VBUS/ESD; CAN1/USART1-flow-control conflicts must reject. See "
"[USB packet contract](../design/usb-device.md)."

msgid "以下纵切片拥有独立生产机制和开发证据，最终配置、SDK 与完整镜像接入分别验收。 不能将其中一项的模型通过记为整个平台或参考 PCB 通过。"
msgstr ""
"The following slices have independent production mechanisms/development "
"evidence. Final configuration/SDK/full-image integration are accepted "
"separately. One passed model cannot mean whole-platform/reference-PCB "
"acceptance."

msgid "可选机制"
msgstr "Optional mechanism"

msgid "精确范围与当前边界"
msgstr "Exact scope and current boundary"

msgid "Input capture"
msgstr "Input capture"

msgid ""
"STM TIM4 CH1 / GD TIMER3 CH0，PB6 AF2、16-bit modulo count、caller event "
"ring；软件观测时间不是 edge aperture；装配接入独立验收"
msgstr ""
"STM TIM4 CH1 / GD TIMER3 CH0, PB6 AF2, 16-bit modulo counts, caller event "
"rings; software observation time is not edge aperture; assembly integration "
"separately accepted"

msgid "Complementary PWM / break"
msgstr "Complementary PWM / break"

msgid ""
"STM TIM1 / GD TIMER0，PA8/PB13/PB12 AF1；不可变精确 deadtime 与 "
"BKIN，禁止自动重启；没有功率级安全资格"
msgstr ""
"STM TIM1 / GD TIMER0, PA8/PB13/PB12 AF1; immutable exact deadtime/BKIN, no "
"automatic restart; no power-stage safety qualification"

msgid "User I/O broker"
msgstr "User I/O broker"

msgid ""
"特权 kernel 调用的 scalar GPIO read/set-reset、真实 principal/pin/copy/unpin "
"窄端口；U575 独立无 OS 参考接入同步 CMSE gateway；无通用 SVC、多任务 userspace transport 或异步用户 "
"DMA"
msgstr ""
"Privileged-kernel scalar GPIO read/set-reset with actual "
"principal/pin/copy/unpin narrow ports; independent OS-free U575 synchronous "
"CMSE gateway; no generic SVC/multitask-userspace transport/asynchronous user"
" DMA"

msgid ""
"G474 的封装 GPIO、六个 UART、SPI1/2、IWDG 与 PA0/PA1 EXTI 分别具有明确的 "
"生产实现和生成夹具。LPUART1、USART1/2/3、UART4/5 只维护 IRQ bytes；SPI 为 8-bit、mode 0..3、显式 "
"active-low CS，每笔最多 256 bytes，当前 170 MHz profile 接纳 requested SCK 664063 "
"Hz..42.5 MHz；无 DMA、RX event/block 或任意 AF 自动选择。 实际接线仍须 Board "
"授权；源码、预算、方法保留和向量检查不证明实物的 MCU、X3 晶振、VCP／LD2 焊桥或 SPI 电气。 [初次 SoC 执行记录](soc-"
"refinement-verification.md) 保留其历史 code revision； [扩展执行记录](soc-extensions-"
"verification.md) 单独绑定后续扩展的源码和证据。 离线复现与候选封存仍有独立 退出条件，不能继承此前 F407/F470 候选的资格。"
msgstr ""
"G474 package GPIO, six UARTs, SPI1/2, IWDG and PA0/PA1 EXTI each have "
"explicit production implementations and generated fixtures. LPUART1, "
"USART1/2/3 and UART4/5 maintain IRQ bytes only. SPI uses 8-bit words, modes "
"0..3, explicit active-low CS and at most 256 bytes per call; the current 170"
" MHz profile admits requested SCK from 664063 Hz to 42.5 MHz. There is no "
"DMA, RX event/block mode or arbitrary automatic AF selection. Actual wiring "
"still requires Board authorization. Source, budget, method-retention and "
"vector checks do not establish the physical MCU, X3 crystal, VCP/LD2 bridges"
" or SPI electrical behavior. [Initial SoC records](soc-refinement-"
"verification.md) preserve their historical code revision; [extension "
"records](soc-extensions-verification.md) bind later source and evidence "
"separately. Offline reproduction and candidate sealing have independent "
"exits and cannot inherit the earlier F407/F470 candidate qualification."

msgid ""
"G474 的 `fixed-pwm` 仅维护 TIM3 CH1／PA6 AF2 与 TIM4 CH1／PB6 AF2，分别独占整个 "
"controller。`tick_hz` 必须与 170 MHz 时钟形成 1..65536 的整数分频；固定 period 为 1..65535 "
"ticks，duty 为 0..period，active-high、edge-aligned，显式处理 0/100%。 stop 先观察 "
"CCER/CEN 关闭，再建立 Board 声明的 GPIO inactive；无法证明停止时保留 fault 与 clock lease，交给私有 "
"close 重试。PA6 与 SPI1 MISO 冲突；不提供共享 timer base、互补输出、capture、break、PWM IRQ 或 "
"DMA。模型、factory 和 ARM 夹具不能 证明真实输出频率、负载或电气安全。"
msgstr ""
"G474 `fixed-pwm` maintains only TIM3 CH1/PA6 AF2 and TIM4 CH1/PB6 AF2, each "
"owning the whole controller. `tick_hz` must divide the 170 MHz clock exactly"
" with an integer divisor from 1..65536. Fixed periods are 1..65535 ticks and"
" duty is 0..period, active-high and edge-aligned, with explicit 0/100% "
"handling. Stop observes CCER/CEN disabled before establishing the Board-"
"declared GPIO inactive level. An unproved stop retains the fault and clock "
"lease for private close retry. PA6 conflicts with SPI1 MISO. Shared timer "
"bases, complementary outputs, capture, break, PWM IRQ and DMA are not "
"provided. Models, factory and ARM fixtures do not establish physical output "
"frequency, loads or electrical safety."

msgid ""
"U575 的 TZEN0 Platform 维护所选 GPIO、USART1/2 IRQ bytes、IWDG 与上述六类有限外设；GPIOH 只接纳 "
"PH0/PH1/PH3。 PG2..PG15 还要求外部电源 owner 已建立 VDDIO2、PWR clock 和 IO2SV；平台不打开 "
"未知外部电源，也不把 IO2SV 当作电压测量。独立 TZEN=1 参考的分区、固定 principal 和同步借用前提见 [TrustZone "
"合同](../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md)，不能扩大 TZEN=0 factory 或授予异步跨域 DMA。"
msgstr ""
"The U575 TZEN0 Platform maintains selected GPIO, USART1/2 IRQ bytes, IWDG "
"and the six finite peripheral classes above; GPIOH admits PH0/PH1/PH3 only. "
"PG2..PG15 additionally require an external power owner to establish VDDIO2, "
"the PWR clock and IO2SV. The Platform neither enables an unknown external "
"supply nor treats IO2SV as a voltage measurement. Partitioning, the fixed "
"principal and synchronous-borrow prerequisites of the independent TZEN=1 "
"reference are defined by [the TrustZone contract](../design/u575-trustzone-"
"contract.md); they do not expand the TZEN=0 factory or authorize "
"asynchronous cross-domain DMA."

msgid ""
"F103 的 1 MHz TIM2 是 16-bit，overflow IRQ 服务及中断屏蔽间隔必须小于名义 65.536 ms。GD303 以 "
"TIMER1 的更新 TRGO 驱动 TIMER4 组成硬件级联，要求 high overflow IRQ 在 4,294,967,296 µs "
"内服务；实际 carry 传播仍须 HIL 核对。 两者均只修正一个 pending full wrap，不把软件观察时间当作实测精度。 两者的 SPI"
" 均为 8-bit、mode 0..3、有界轮询，每笔最多 256 bytes，31.25 kHz..4 MHz； F103 使用 SPI1，GD303"
" 使用 SPI0。F103 的 PA5 同时连接 LED 与 SPI SCK，不能冲突 选择。具体接入与失败停止合同见 "
"[F103](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32f103/README.md) 和 [GD303](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/gd32f303/README.md)；没有把这些切片提升为全系列或全外设支持。"
msgstr ""
"F103's 1 MHz TIM2 is 16-bit; overflow IRQ service and interrupt-mask "
"intervals must remain below nominal 65.536 ms. GD303 uses TIMER1 update TRGO"
" to drive TIMER4 in a hardware cascade, requiring high-overflow IRQ service "
"within 4,294,967,296 µs; actual carry propagation still needs HIL. Both "
"correct only one pending full wrap and do not turn software observation time"
" into measured accuracy. Both SPI selections use 8-bit modes 0..3 and "
"bounded polling, at most 256 bytes per call and 31.25 kHz..4 MHz. F103 uses "
"SPI1 and GD303 SPI0. F103 PA5 connects both LED and SPI SCK, so conflicting "
"selections reject. See [F103](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f103/README.md) and "
"[GD303](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/gd32f303/README.md) for exact integration and failure-stop "
"contracts; these slices do not grant whole-family or all-peripheral support."

msgid ""
"F103/GD303 的 UART channel-DMA 仅接纳声明 SRAM 的 1..65535-byte span；TX-only 实例保留紧凑"
" TX 状态和 IRQ byte ring，duplex 才增加调用者 block 接收扩展。DMA TC 不能替代真实 UART TC。正常模式 RX"
" 在撤回 DMA、稳定 count 后发布，owner service 重新装填，存在间隙；不覆写消费者 loan。I2C 固定 PB6/PB7、名义 "
"80 kHz、7-bit， IRQ priority0 的接收窗口保留进入前 mask，拒绝内核通知；无隐式 bus-clear。"
msgstr ""
"F103/GD303 UART channel-DMA admits only declared SRAM spans of 1..65535 "
"bytes. TX-only instances retain compact TX state and an IRQ-byte ring; "
"duplex alone adds the caller's receive-block extension. DMA TC cannot "
"replace actual UART TC. Normal RX publishes after DMA withdrawal and stable "
"count; owner service rearms with gaps and never overwrites a consumer loan. "
"I2C fixes PB6/PB7, nominal 80 kHz and 7-bit addressing. Priority-zero "
"receive windows preserve the incoming mask and reject kernel notifications; "
"no implicit bus-clear is provided."

msgid "新增外设的有限合同"
msgstr "Finite contracts for added peripherals"

msgid ""
"G474 的独立 acquisition 夹具选择 ADC1 PA0/IN1、12-bit bulb sampling、 "
"SYSCLK/128=1.328125 MHz、sample code0。TIM6 正常 DMA block 只接纳精确整除 1 MHz 的 "
"2.5–50 kHz；孔径由前次 EOC 到下次 trigger 决定，不能从 SMPR 单独推算。 每次丢弃首次转换，发布前停止 "
"trigger、DMA/ADC 并观察 ADEN 关闭；下一次 service 重启，具有间隙。I2C1 PB8/PB9 使用独立 "
"HSI16、固定标准模式 timing。具体预热、 校准、勘误和内存合同以 [G474](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32g474/README.md) 为准。"
msgstr ""
"The separate G474 acquisition fixture selects ADC1 PA0/IN1, 12-bit bulb "
"sampling, SYSCLK/128=1.328125 MHz and sample code0. TIM6 normal-DMA blocks "
"admit only 2.5–50 kHz rates dividing 1 MHz exactly. Aperture depends on the "
"previous EOC and next trigger, not SMPR alone. Each activation discards the "
"first conversion; publication follows trigger/DMA/ADC withdrawal and "
"observed ADEN clear. A later service restarts with gaps. I2C1 PB8/PB9 uses "
"independent HSI16 and fixed Standard-mode timing. "
"[G474](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32g474/README.md) owns the exact warmup, calibration, errata "
"and memory contracts."

msgid ""
"H743 新有限外设使用独立软件 Board 包；不能把 SPI4、I2C1、PA3 ADC1、PA6 TIM3 及 EXTI 的选择推成 NUCLEO"
" 实板接线。可选 D2 SRAM1 有独立预算和启动 DATA/BSS 初始化；NOINIT 由调用者初始化，DMA 借用前再查 SRAM1 "
"gate。Cache-on DMA 要求 独占完整 32-byte lines。FIG-09 的 AXI-only TX "
"图是一个精确参考，不枚举这些新增 放置或有限 RX 模式。详见 [H743 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)。"
msgstr ""
"New H743 finite peripherals use a separate software Board package; selecting"
" SPI4, I2C1, PA3 ADC1, PA6 TIM3 and EXTI does not establish NUCLEO physical "
"wiring. Optional D2 SRAM1 has independent budgeting and startup DATA/BSS "
"initialization. Callers initialize NOINIT, and DMA rechecks the SRAM1 gate "
"before borrowing. Cache-on DMA requires exclusively owned complete 32-byte "
"lines. FIG-09's AXI-only TX diagram is one exact reference, not an inventory"
" of the added placements or finite RX modes. See [the H743 "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)."

msgid ""
"U575 的 SPI1/I2C1/ADC4/PWM/EXTI/Flash 仍处于 TZEN0。ADC4 单次采样要求外部 VDDA、电源时钟及 "
"ASV；SPI1 MISO 与 TIM3 CH1 共用 PA6，必须使用互斥装配。 独立 TZEN1 参考只把最多八项同步 GPIO 消息复制到 "
"Secure 私有存储，不提供这些 新外设的通用双域 factory 或异步 transport。详见 "
"[U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/README.md) 及 [双域合同](../design/u575-trustzone-"
"contract.md)。"
msgstr ""
"U575 SPI1/I2C1/ADC4/PWM/EXTI/Flash remain TZEN0 selections. ADC4 shots "
"require external VDDA, the power clock and ASV. SPI1 MISO and TIM3 CH1 share"
" PA6, so their assemblies must be mutually exclusive. The separate TZEN1 "
"reference only copies up to eight synchronous GPIO commands into private "
"Secure storage; it supplies no generic dual-world factory or asynchronous "
"transport for the new peripherals. See [U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/README.md) and [the "
"dual-world contract](../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md)."

msgid "精确 Flash"
msgstr "Exact Flash"

msgid "物理几何与编程粒度"
msgstr "Physical geometry and program unit"

msgid "F103RB"
msgstr "F103RB"

msgid "128 × 1 KiB page；2-byte halfword"
msgstr "128 × 1 KiB page；2-byte halfword"

msgid "GD303RC"
msgstr "GD303RC"

msgid "128 × 2 KiB page；2-byte halfword"
msgstr "128 × 2 KiB page；2-byte halfword"

msgid "G474RE"
msgstr "G474RE"

msgid "DBANK=1、未交换映射；256 × 2 KiB page；8-byte ECC doubleword"
msgstr "DBANK=1, unswapped mapping; 256 × 2 KiB pages; 8-byte ECC doubleword"

msgid "H743ZI"
msgstr "H743ZI"

msgid "未交换两 bank；16 × 128 KiB sector；32-byte ECC flashword；Cache off"
msgstr ""
"Two unswapped banks; 16 × 128 KiB sectors; 32-byte ECC flashword; Cache off"

msgid "U575ZIQ"
msgstr "U575ZIQ"

msgid "TZEN0/SWAP0；256 × 8 KiB page；16-byte ECC quadword"
msgstr "TZEN0/SWAP0；256 × 8 KiB page；16-byte ECC quadword"

msgid ""
"公共 `geometry.program_flags` 的 `NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE` 要求 "
"调用者证明 ECC 编程单元自成功擦除后未经历其他编程脉冲；FF 读回不能证明隐藏 ECC 历史，失败／中断后必须重新擦除；零 flags 也不豁免所选"
" provider 自身的编程规则。 全 FF 输入跳过物理脉冲。每个已开始的脉冲必须 取得新完成证据并排空后才返回；deadline "
"仅阻止下一脉冲，不中止硬件操作。产品显式 提供供电声明、擦除对齐区域、同 bank 取指停顿、watchdog 与掉电恢复政策。模型与 "
"链接不建立模拟精度、实测脉冲时间、Flash 掉电或 Cache 一致性资格；所有 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`。当前源码实现与最终 "
"clean-source 软件资格分别记录，不继承历史计数。"
msgstr ""
"Public `geometry.program_flags` may set "
"`NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE`, requiring callers to prove that an "
"ECC program unit has received no other program pulse since a successful "
"erase. FF readback cannot prove hidden ECC history; failed/interrupted "
"pulses require another erase. Zero flags do not waive the selected "
"provider's own programming rules. All-FF source units skip the physical "
"pulse. Every started pulse obtains fresh completion evidence and drains "
"before return. Deadlines prevent later pulses rather than aborting hardware."
" Products explicitly own supply declarations, erase-aligned regions, same-"
"bank fetch stalls, watchdog and power-loss recovery. Models and linking "
"establish neither analog accuracy, measured pulse timing, Flash power-cut "
"behavior nor Cache coherency; all HIL remains `not_executed`. Current source"
" implementation and final clean-source software qualification are recorded "
"separately without inherited historical counts."

msgid ""
"完成标志的锁存前提按家族区分：F407/G474/U575 需要对应 EOPIE，GD470 需要 ENDIE；polling owner "
"暂时取得这些位时，FLASH IRQ 仍保持 NVIC disabled、无 active/pending 的独占准入，结束清源、上锁并确认 "
"pending 撤回。F103/GD303/H743 的完成标志按其寄存器合同无条件锁存，不照搬其他家族的 interrupt-enable 要求。 "
"具体脉冲与清理约束见 [主流接入合同](../design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Completion-flag latching is family-specific: F407/G474/U575 require their "
"EOPIE and GD470 requires ENDIE. While the polling owner temporarily acquires"
" these bits, the FLASH IRQ remains NVIC-disabled under exclusive admission "
"with no active/pending state. Cleanup removes sources, locks and observes "
"pending withdrawal. F103/GD303/H743 completion flags latch unconditionally "
"under their register contracts; other families' interrupt-enable "
"requirements are not copied onto them. See [the mainstream integration "
"contract](../design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md) for pulse and cleanup "
"requirements."

msgid ""
"Ethernet 生成夹具保留精确 TX/RX descriptors 与 RX buffers，只接纳 STM 主 SRAM 128 KiB 或 GD"
" 主 SRAM192 KiB。四个 ZG ARM graph 的开发预算/retention 通过不 授权 GD ADDSRAM/TCM、STM "
"CCM、VE100 的 PG route 或某个产品 PHY。独立 cold review、clean-source SDK "
"与实板资格仍各自建立，参考默认镜像不选入 ETH/MDIO。"
msgstr ""
"Ethernet fixtures retain exact TX/RX descriptors/RX buffers and admit only "
"STM main SRAM128 KiB/GD main SRAM192 KiB. Development budget/retention on "
"four ZG ARM graphs authorize no GD ADDSRAM/TCM, STM CCM, VE100 PG routes or "
"product PHY. Independent cold review/clean-source SDK/physical qualification"
" remain separate. Default references select no ETH/MDIO."

msgid "有限 DMA 的精确首发路线如下，其他 controller／通道组合由 resolver 拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Exact bounded-DMA launch routes follow; the resolver rejects other "
"controller/channel combinations."

