msgstr "ADC1; TIM3 TRGO; DMA2 stream4 channel0"

msgid "ADC0；TIMER2 TRGO；DMA1 channel0 selector0"
msgstr "ADC0; TIMER2 TRGO; DMA1 channel0 selector0"

msgid ""
"已审查的软件 Board 配置支持 STM32F407 I2C1/I2C2 与 GD32F470 I2C0/I2C1 的 IRQ/DMA 装配及 "
"typed factory；双控制器夹具已有独立实例隔离与真实 SDK 链接证据。 参考 Board 只开放明确声明的 "
"binding；其他硅片路线与实际接线需单独审查。详见 [多控制器所有权](../design/multiple-controllers.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed software-Board configurations support STM32F407 I2C1/I2C2 and "
"GD32F470 I2C0/I2C1 IRQ/DMA assembly/typed factories. Dual-controller "
"fixtures have independent-instance isolation/real-SDK link evidence. "
"Reference Boards expose declared bindings only; other silicon routes/actual "
"wiring require separate review. See [multicontroller "
"ownership](../design/multiple-controllers.md)."

msgid ""
"SPI DMA 要求非空、不重叠的 TX／RX 实际访问跨度；固定地址方向只访问调用者的一字节。 不分配 scratch 或隐式复制池。实际 "
"memory domain 与读写权限由 provider 再次校验；STM CCM、GD TCM 均不能作为 DMA 缓冲。DMA TC "
"表示内存传输事实，UART TC／SPI idle 表示线上事实；两者排空证明 都满足后才发布 SETTLED。取消、超时或 EN "
"拒绝关闭保留借用，进入 QUARANTINED。"
msgstr ""
"SPI DMA requires nonempty/nonoverlapping actual TX/RX spans; fixed-address "
"directions access caller one-byte storage only. No scratch/implicit copy "
"pool is allocated. Providers recheck actual memory domains/permissions; STM "
"CCM/GD TCM cannot be DMA buffers. DMA TC is a memory fact; UART TC/SPI idle "
"are line facts. Both drain proofs precede SETTLED. Cancellation/timeout/EN-"
"disable refusal retain borrows in QUARANTINED."

msgid ""
"ADC 的 `trigger-dma` 使用普通有限 DMA；每块停止触发、转换与内存写入，再发布完整块。 调用者必须显式 "
"service，完成上电稳定／GD 校准后重新触发下一块。无空闲 loan 时 "
"保持暂停，不覆写、不伪造暂停期间的精确丢样数。该模式有块间间隙，不承诺连续 无间隙采样。`trigger-dma-continuous` "
"则显式选择硬件双缓冲及预投递块，地址替换 成功后发布完整块；至少需要三个调用者 slot。频率需满足精确 timer divider 和 整段 scan"
" 转换时间；GD 连续模式显式选择 SDK 对应的 sample-time code，有限模式 保持原有 15-cycle sample。可选 "
"observer 的时间戳是软件发布观测时间，不是采样 孔径时间。单个锁存 TC/CT 事实无法计算未观测的多轮丢样。stop 在持有 loan 时返回"
" BUSY。"
msgstr ""
"ADC `trigger-dma` uses ordinary bounded DMA: stop trigger/conversion/memory "
"writes per block before publishing complete blocks. Callers explicitly "
"service stabilization/GD calibration before next trigger. No free loan means"
" pause without overwriting/invented exact missed samples. Inter-block gaps "
"are expected. `trigger-dma-continuous` explicitly selects hardware double "
"buffers/preposted blocks, publishing after successful replacement; at least "
"three caller slots are needed. Frequency must satisfy exact timer "
"division/full scan time. GD continuous selects SDK sample-time codes; "
"bounded mode retains 15-cycle samples. Optional timestamps are software "
"publication observations, not sampling apertures. One latched TC/CT cannot "
"count unobserved multiple rounds. Stop with outstanding loans returns BUSY."

msgid ""
"I2C 中断及 DMA 共享经过两家 SDK 布局与位定义检查的 V1 寄存器算法，MCU 热路径 直接访问寄存器。DMA TC "
"不代表线上完成；最后字节、BTF、STOP/MSL、DMA EN 和 IRQ 发布者必须排空后才 SETTLED。bus-clear "
"独立要求静止外设、独占开漏 GPIO 和 有界等待，最多九个完成的恢复脉冲；STOP 或释放失败保留 lease，可继续清理。 平台没有为未经审查的 "
"Board 自动切换引脚。详见 [I2C 总线恢复](../design/i2c-bus-clear.md)。"
msgstr ""
"I2C IRQ/DMA share a V1 register algorithm checked against both SDK "
"layouts/bits; MCU hot paths access registers directly. DMA TC is not wire "
"completion. Final byte/BTF/STOP-MSL/DMA-EN/IRQ publishers drain before "
"SETTLED. Separate bus-clear requires quiescent peripherals, exclusive open-"
"drain GPIO and bounded waits; at most nine completed pulses. STOP/release "
"failure retains leases for cleanup retries. No automatic pin switching "
"occurs on unreviewed Boards. See [I2C recovery](../design/i2c-bus-clear.md)."

msgid ""
"这些是 **SoC 实现能力**。参考 Board 默认 binding、软件测试夹具路线、现场测量结果 各自独立。STM32 默认参考 Board "
"未声明可资格化的 SPI CS，资源矩阵只测 empty/GPIO/UART；软件 fixture 的 SPI 不能继承为参考板 SPI 支持。GD32"
" 默认 Board 的 SPI4 PF6/7/8/9 有公开来源，外接 NOR 具体料号仍未知。"
msgstr ""
"These are **SoC implementation capabilities**. Default reference bindings, "
"software-fixture routes and field measurements are independent. STM defaults"
" declare no qualifiable SPI CS; resource matrices measure only "
"empty/GPIO/UART, so fixture SPI does not qualify reference-board SPI. "
"Default GD SPI4 PF6/7/8/9 has public provenance; external NOR exact part "
"remains unknown."

msgid "明确边界"
msgstr "Explicit boundaries"

msgid ""
"连续模式不能承诺任意 IRQ 延迟与消费者速度下无丢失。I2C 超出 256-byte 的 read、 动态 clock、deep "
"sleep/STOP、安全启动／升级及上述未维护模式明确不提供。 FreeRTOS 可选 `lowpower_port=\"timebase\"` "
"只在固定 F407/GD470 profile 使用浅 Sleep； 要求 SysTick、tickless、single privileged、无 "
"MPU。默认 `custom` 不新增 sleep 机制；CPU-only runtime 缺少 SoC timebase "
"时拒绝该选择。实际相位、clock 连续性、 wake latency 与功耗保持物理未执行，见[浅睡眠](../design/timebase-"
"lowpower.md)。 Unsupported 配置明确拒绝，不通过成功 stub 声称支持。"
msgstr ""
"Continuous modes promise no losslessness under arbitrary IRQ "
"latency/consumer speed. I2C reads beyond 256 bytes, dynamic clocks, deep "
"sleep/STOP, secure boot/update and unmaintained modes are unavailable. "
"FreeRTOS `lowpower_port=\"timebase\"` uses shallow Sleep only on fixed "
"F407/GD470 profiles, requiring SysTick/tickless/single-privileged/no-MPU. "
"Default `custom` adds no sleep mechanism; CPU-only runtime without SoC "
"timebase rejects the choice. Actual phase/clock continuity/wake "
"latency/power are physically unexecuted; see [shallow "
"sleep](../design/timebase-lowpower.md). Unsupported configurations reject "
"explicitly rather than claim support through successful stubs."

msgid ""
"Flash pulse 不能被 deadline 撤销；BUSY 未清不能释放责任。产品负责 Flash 执行 停顿、电压、watchdog "
"窗口、掉电、认证、布局与持久化格式迁移。公共通用 storage 的 CRC/commit 机制不等于安全升级协议。"
msgstr ""
"Deadlines cannot cancel Flash pulses; uncleared BUSY retains responsibility."
" Products own Flash stalls/voltage/watchdog windows/power "
"cuts/authentication/layout/persistent-format migration. Generic storage "
"CRC/commit is not a secure-update protocol."

msgid ""
"GD32 Flash 的重新上锁读回失败会保留静态 provider 并拒绝继续操作，需要受控 复位；普通 stop "
"不能恢复此状态。`tests/google/gd32_flash_fault_test.cpp` 专项模型 "
"验证故障后拒绝读取／写入／重新取得控制器，不构成实板资格。 生命周期与扫描诊断的解释见[安全审查](security-review.md)。"
msgstr ""
"GD32 Flash relock-readback failure retains static providers/rejects further "
"operations and requires controlled reset; ordinary stop cannot recover it. "
"`tests/google/gd32_flash_fault_test.cpp` checks postfault "
"read/write/controller-reacquisition refusal, without physical qualification."
" See [security review](security-review.md) for lifecycle/scan diagnostics."

msgid ""
"硬件未接入，全部 MCU 目标的 clock、reset、GPIO safe output、UART TC/abort/RX、SPI/I2C "
"电气、Flash 掉电、watchdog reset、EXTI 波形、PWM 与 ADC 精度均未执行。当前 支持声明不能替代物理 HIL 或产品 "
"release promotion。"
msgstr ""
"Hardware is disconnected. Clock/reset/GPIO-safe-output/UART-TC-abort-"
"RX/SPI-I2C-electrical/Flash-power-cut/watchdog-reset/EXTI-waveform/PWM/ADC-"
"precision execution is absent for every MCU target. Current support cannot "
"replace physical HIL or product-release promotion."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:0
msgid "原有 Raw Ethernet `eth` / MDIO / DP83848"
msgstr "Existing raw Ethernet `eth` / MDIO / DP83848"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:0
msgid ""
"Native/ST/GD normal chained descriptor、RMII、14–1514-byte untagged Ethernet "
"II、caller-owned RX loan；ETH/MDIO face 共用一个 MAC context；ST ZG/GD ZG 软件夹具已有 "
"factory 与裸机/FreeRTOS ELF；该 face 不提供 SG、VLAN 或硬件时间戳；无协议栈、checksum "
"offload、jumbo"
msgstr ""
"Native/ST/GD normal chained descriptors, RMII, 14–1514-byte untagged "
"Ethernet II and caller-owned RX loans; ETH/MDIO faces share one MAC context;"
" ST ZG/GD ZG software fixtures have factory and baremetal/FreeRTOS ELF "
"checks; this face has no SG, VLAN or hardware timestamps; no protocol stack,"
" checksum offload or jumbo frames"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:0
msgid "增强 Ethernet `eth_frames` / MDIO"
msgstr "Enhanced Ethernet `eth_frames` / MDIO"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F407／GD470 精确 RMII 参考及 Native 模型；`rmii-vlan-sg-ptp` 选择独立状态、八字 descriptor、完整 "
"SG frame loan、单个带内 VLAN C-tag 和 MAC 硬件事件时间戳；裸机软件夹具与独立开发证据；不能与原有 `eth` 同时占用一个"
" MAC；无 tag 插入／剥离、checksum offload、jumbo、网络时间同步或协议栈；实板未执行"
msgstr ""
"Exact F407/GD470 RMII references and a Native model; `rmii-vlan-sg-ptp` "
"selects independent state, eight-word descriptors, complete SG frame loans, "
"one in-band VLAN C-tag and MAC hardware-event timestamps; baremetal software"
" fixtures with separate development evidence; it cannot share a MAC with the"
" existing `eth` face; no tag insertion/stripping, checksum offload, jumbo "
"frames, network clock synchronization or protocol stack; physical execution "
"is pending"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:107
msgid ""
"参考 Board 默认不声明 Ethernet PHY/REFCLK/reset 接线。启明 ZG 可选 RMII 来源 涉及 "
"PG11/13/14，因此不授权 VE100 封装；天空星和梁山派无 reviewed PHY 路线。 协议、电缆、PHY power/reset、产品"
" MAC 地址和恢复策略留在外部。详见 "
"[Ethernet](../design/ethernet.md)、[增强帧合同](../design/ethernet-frames.md)、[高级 "
"timer](../design/timer-advanced.md)、 [用户 I/O broker](../design/user-io-"
"broker.md) 与 [G474](../design/stm32g474.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Reference Boards do not declare Ethernet PHY/REFCLK/reset wiring by default."
" The optional Qiming ZG RMII source uses PG11/13/14 and therefore does not "
"authorize the VE100 package; Sky and Liangshan have no reviewed PHY route. "
"Protocols, cables, PHY power/reset, product MAC addresses and recovery "
"policies remain external. See [Ethernet](../design/ethernet.md), [enhanced "
"frames](../design/ethernet-frames.md), [advanced timers](../design/timer-"
"advanced.md), [the user I/O broker](../design/user-io-broker.md) and "
"[G474](../design/stm32g474.md)."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:143
msgid ""
"H743 SPI4 的独立有限 `dma` 模式选择 DEV_ID `0x450`、REV_ID `0x2003`（V）、 HSI64 默认 "
"trim、Cache off/on 和裸机。PE12/PE13/PE14 AF5 与 PE11 active-low CS 是软件路线；DMA1 "
"Stream2/3 分别负责 RX/TX，只接纳已初始化 AXI SRAM 中互不重叠的 TX/RX span；Cache off 为 1..65535"
" bytes，Cache on 的地址和长度须为独占完整 32-byte lines，长度为 32..65504 bytes。可与独立 USART3 "
"Stream0 TX 或 Stream1 RX 配置组合；不开放 PLL384、FreeRTOS、16-bit、固定 dummy/discard "
"或多段传输。精确约束见 [H743 provider 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The independent H743 SPI4 finite `dma` mode selects DEV_ID `0x450`, REV_ID "
"`0x2003` (V), HSI64/default trim, Cache off/on and baremetal. PE12/PE13/PE14"
" AF5 and PE11 active-low CS are software routes. DMA1 Stream2/3 handle RX/TX"
" and admit only non-overlapping TX/RX spans in initialized AXI SRAM. Cache "
"off accepts 1..65535 bytes; Cache on requires exclusive complete 32-byte "
"lines, with aligned addresses and lengths of 32..65504 bytes. It may combine"
" with independent USART3 Stream0 TX or Stream1 RX selections. PLL384, "
"FreeRTOS, 16-bit, fixed dummy/discard and multisegment transfers are "
"excluded. See the [H743 provider contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:132
msgid ""
"H743 USART3 的 `dma-tx` 使用 DMA1 Stream0、DMAMUX1 channel0/request46，RX 保持 IRQ "
"byte ring；`rx-dma-idle` 使用 DMA1 Stream1、DMAMUX1 channel1/request45， TX 保持 "
"IRQ。二者是显式替代模式，不自动组合成 DMA duplex。仅接纳所选且已初始化的 AXI SRAM／D2 SRAM1； Cache off "
"每块／每笔为 1..65535 bytes，Cache on 地址和长度必须按 32 bytes 对齐、 长度最多 65504 "
"bytes，调用者独占完整 cache line。TX 在 clean 后启动；RX 在 DMA 前及排空后 "
"invalidate，稳定剩余计数和维护完成后才发布完整块或 IDLE prefix。 引用、通道、DMAR 或 cache "
"维护未排空都保留借用；消费者持有块时保留 stream 与 平台依赖。这两个有限模式由 owner service 发布并重新接纳下一块，可能出现间隙；"
" 它们不提供 circular 或双缓冲 RX，也不扩大其他 DMA engine、RAM 放置或运行中变频。Cache 配置在平台生命周期内固定，全部"
" provider 排空后才能关闭时基及 Cache。"
msgstr ""
"H743 USART3 `dma-tx` uses DMA1 Stream0 and DMAMUX1 channel0/request46, "
"retaining an IRQ-byte RX ring; `rx-dma-idle` uses DMA1 Stream1 and DMAMUX1 "
"channel1/request45, retaining IRQ TX. These are explicit alternatives, "
"without automatic DMA duplex composition. Only selected initialized AXI "
"SRAM/D2 SRAM1 is admitted. Cache off accepts 1..65535 bytes per "
"block/request; Cache on requires 32-byte-aligned addresses and lengths up to"
" 65504 bytes with exclusive complete cache lines. TX starts after clean; RX "
"invalidates before DMA and after drain, publishing a full block or IDLE "
"prefix only after stable remaining-count observation and maintenance. "
"Unjoined references, channels, DMAR or cache maintenance retain the borrow; "
"consumer-held blocks retain the stream and platform dependencies. These two "
"finite modes publish and rearm through owner service and may have gaps; they"
" do not provide circular or double-buffer RX or extend other DMA engines, "
"RAM placement or runtime clock changes. Cache configuration remains fixed "
"throughout the platform lifecycle; all providers must drain before the "
"timebase and Cache close."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:161
msgid ""
"U575 USART1 的 `dma-tx` 选择 GPDMA1 channel0/request25、TZEN0、MSIS4、8N1 和 Cache "
"off，只接纳非安全 SRAM1 中 1..65535 bytes；USART1 RX 仍使用 IRQ byte ring。 DMAT 按 ES0499"
" 保持到 UART 完整停止证明 UE／ACK、两路 IRQ 与 publisher 完整撤回， 不能用 DMA TCF 代替 UART 线上 TC "
"或最终借用排空。独立 `irq-fifo-bytes` 模式有 显式阈值与每次 IRQ RX/TX 字节预算，不与 GPDMA 混用。两个模式均不扩大 "
"USART2、 TrustZone 或低功耗范围；见 [有限 GPDMA](../design/u575-uart-gpdma.md)和 [FIFO "
"IRQ 合同](../design/uart-fifo.md)。"
msgstr ""
"U575 USART1 `dma-tx` selects GPDMA1 channel0/request25, TZEN0, MSIS4, 8N1 "
"and Cache off, admitting only 1..65535 bytes in nonsecure SRAM1; RX retains "
"its IRQ-byte ring. Under ES0499, DMAT persists until full UART stop proves "
"UE/ACK withdrawal and joins both IRQs and publishers. DMA TCF cannot replace"
" wire TC or final borrow drain. The separate `irq-fifo-bytes` mode has "
"explicit thresholds and per-IRQ RX/TX byte budgets and does not combine with"
" GPDMA. Neither mode extends USART2, TrustZone or low power; see [finite "
"GPDMA](../design/u575-uart-gpdma.md) and the [FIFO IRQ "
"contract](../design/uart-fifo.md)."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:169
msgid ""
"独立 `dma-chain-tx` 复用同一 USART1、GPDMA1 channel0/request25 和 IRQ-byte RX。 "
"一次请求仍借用连续 SRAM1 span，协议上限 196605 bytes，还须完整落入可达 RAM 且与 所有 live "
"state／ring／facts／nodes 不重叠；最多三块，每块最多 65535 bytes。 两个 packed 12-byte 私有节点组成 "
"24-byte 数组，整个数组按 32 bytes 对齐并位于 同一 64 KiB CLBAR 窗口；节点与 payload 均保留到 "
"fetch／channel／IRQ 排空及独立 UART TC 已观察。它不开放 SG、循环链、RX DMA 或低功耗自主运行。"
msgstr ""
"The separate `dma-chain-tx` mode reuses USART1, GPDMA1 channel0/request25 "
"and IRQ-byte RX. One request still borrows a contiguous SRAM1 span, with a "
"protocol limit of 196605 bytes that must also fit entirely in reachable RAM "
"without overlapping live state, rings, facts or nodes; there are at most "
"three blocks of at most 65535 bytes each. Two packed 12-byte private nodes "
"form a 24-byte array, with the entire array aligned to 32 bytes within one "
"64 KiB CLBAR window. Nodes and payload remain live until fetch/channel/IRQ "
"drain and independently observed UART TC. It does not enable SG, cyclic "
"chains, RX DMA or autonomous low-power operation."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:176
msgid ""
"独立无引脚 LPTIM2 `irq-counter16-oneshot` 选择 TZEN0、MSIS4、裸机、PCLK1/4 名义 1 MHz 与 "
"IRQ68 priority5/calls_os=false。单次接受 2..65536 ticks，1 tick 因硬件 ARR 必须大于 reset"
" CCR0 而返回 UNSUPPORTED；跨时钟写同步、update completion 与撤源 排空分别观察。它不取得外部引脚或 DMA，不提供 "
"Stop、backup、VBAT 连续性或物理 计时精度证明；参考 Board 未观察 PCB／硅片修订。"
msgstr ""
"The independent pinless LPTIM2 `irq-counter16-oneshot` mode selects TZEN0, "
"MSIS4, baremetal, nominal 1 MHz PCLK1/4 and IRQ68 priority5/calls_os=false. "
"A one-shot accepts 2..65536 ticks; one tick returns UNSUPPORTED because "
"hardware ARR must exceed reset CCR0. Cross-clock write synchronization, "
"update completion and source drain are observed separately. It owns no "
"external pin or DMA and promises no Stop, backup or VBAT continuity or "
"physical timing accuracy. PCB and silicon revision of the reference remain "
"unobserved."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/support.md:143
msgid ""
"独立 `rx-dma-continuous` 模式限定 H743 V、HSI64、裸机和已初始化 AXI SRAM， 使用 USART3、DMA1 "
"Stream1/request45 与 DBM/CIRC 两个硬件 target。调用者提供 至少三个等长、互不重叠的块；Cache off 长度为 "
"32..65535，Cache on 为独占且对齐的 完整 32-byte lines、32..65504 bytes。task service 在同源"
" BRR/TIM2 算出的保守 `replace_by` 之前替换 inactive bank，再完成 Cache 维护并发布；IRQ 不执行 "
"Cache 维护。超过时限、CT 不明确、Cache 失败或无 FREE 块会显式报告 loss、停止生产并保留 "
"借用，直到真实排空；不覆盖旧块或自动重臂。IDLE 结束本次 producer 并发布已排空的 prefix，调用者须显式重新初始化 stream 再 "
"start。TX 仍为独立有限 IRQ，不构成 DMA duplex；开发模型与链接不代表连续无损吞吐、时限或 HIL 资格。"
msgstr ""
"The separate `rx-dma-continuous` mode requires H743 V, HSI64, baremetal and "
"initialized AXI SRAM, using USART3, DMA1 Stream1/request45 and two DBM/CIRC "
"hardware targets. Callers supply at least three equal nonoverlapping blocks:"
" 32..65535 bytes with Cache off, or exclusive complete aligned 32-byte lines"
" of 32..65504 bytes with Cache on. Task service replaces the inactive bank "
"before the conservative `replace_by` derived from the correlated BRR/TIM2 "
"domain, then completes Cache maintenance before publication; IRQs perform no"
" Cache maintenance. A missed deadline, uncertain CT, Cache failure or no "
"FREE block reports loss, stops production and retains loans until actual "
"drain; it never overwrites old blocks or automatically rearms. IDLE closes "
"this producer and publishes the drained prefix; callers must explicitly "
"reinitialize the stream before starting again. TX remains independent finite"
" IRQ, without DMA duplex. Development models and linking do not establish "
"continuous lossless throughput, deadlines or HIL qualification."

msgid ""
"另选 `dma-duplex-continuous` 才在上述精确 V／HSI64／裸机／AXI 参考中增加有限 TX DMA，使用 DMA1 "
"Stream0/request46；RX 仍使用 Stream1/request45。三路向量 分别承担 TX DMA、RX DMA 与 "
"USART 责任，TX 请求／payload 与完整 RX pool、slots 及控制存储必须互不重叠。Cache on 的 TX "
"为独占且对齐的完整 32-byte lines，长度 32..65504 bytes；Cache off 为 1..65535 "
"bytes。DMA TC、线上 TC 和借用排空分别 观察；取消不撤销借用，失败保留 QUARANTINED。成功停止可再次正常启动；冷态恢复 "
"失败保留责任，时钟／timer／cache 失效会永久 taint 当前保留生命周期。该模式不扩大 RTOS、PLL384、D2 SRAM "
"或物理吞吐／Cache 一致性资格。"
msgstr ""
"Only a separately selected `dma-duplex-continuous` adds finite TX DMA to"
" the exact V/HSI64/baremetal/AXI reference above, using DMA1 "
"Stream0/request46 while RX retains Stream1/request45. Three vectors "
"separately own TX DMA, RX DMA and USART duties. TX requests/payloads "
"must be disjoint from the complete RX pool, slots and control storage. "
"Cache-on TX uses exclusive aligned whole 32-byte lines, 32..65504 bytes;"
" Cache-off accepts 1..65535 bytes. DMA TC, wire TC and borrow drain "
"remain distinct. Cancellation does not revoke the borrow; failed drain "
"retains QUARANTINED storage. Successful stop permits another normal "
"startup; failed cold restoration retains responsibility. "
"Clock/timer/Cache loss permanently taints the current retained lifetime."
" This mode does not extend RTOS, PLL384, D2 SRAM or physical "
"throughput/Cache-coherency qualification."

msgid ""
"UART 的 `irq-blocks` 保留独立 IRQ 接收实现；`rx-dma-idle` 使用有限 DMA 与 IDLE， "
"`rx-dma-continuous` 使用硬件双缓冲，另有显式 `dma-duplex` 和 "
"`dma-duplex-continuous`。块由调用者提供，消费者 acquire 后保持不可变，直到匹配 epoch 的 "
"release。连续模式必须预留两个硬件目标及替换块；替换地址读回、目标银行 "
"和新错误检查成立后才能发布旧块。没有替换块就停止，不覆写消费者借用。 仅接收模式使用独立只读方法表，不保留 TX DMA "
"方法与对应链接代码，也不嵌入 TX DMA extension；只有 duplex 实例单独选入该扩展。实际 RAM／Flash 成本仍由同源 "
"linked ELF 测量，不能推导零生命周期开销。RTS/CTS 并不代替 容量和排空合同；RS485 的 DE 引脚、极性及 "
"setup/hold 时间由外部工程明确提供， 到达真实 UART TC 后才开始 hold 并撤销 DE。详见 [UART DMA 与 "
"RS485](../design/uart-dma-rs485.md)。"
msgstr ""
"UART `irq-blocks` keeps independent IRQ RX. `rx-dma-idle` uses bounded "
"DMA/IDLE, `rx-dma-continuous` hardware double buffers; explicit "
"`dma-duplex`/`dma-duplex-continuous` also exist. Caller blocks remain "
"immutable after consumer acquire until matching-epoch release. "
"Continuous modes reserve two hardware targets/replacement blocks. "
"Replacement-address readback, bank/new-error checks precede old-block "
"publication. No replacement means stop, never overwrite consumer loans. "
"RX-only uses a separate read-only table without TX-DMA methods, "
"corresponding linked code or an embedded TX-DMA extension. Only a duplex"
" instance selects that separate extension. Actual RAM/Flash costs still "
"require same-source linked ELF measurements; zero lifecycle overhead "
"cannot be inferred. RTS/CTS does not replace capacity/drain. External "
"RS485 supplies DE pin/polarity/setup-hold; actual UART TC precedes "
"hold/DE withdrawal. See [UART DMA/RS485](../design/uart-dma-rs485.md)."

# Reviewed bounded-scope prose correction; unchanged messages retained.
msgid "Cortex-M7F；2 MiB Flash；AXI SRAM 512 KiB，可显式选入并初始化 D2 SRAM1；pre-RAM LDO、HSI32／HSI64 × Cache off/on、TIM2、GPIO、USART3 IRQ／有限 TX DMA／有限 RX DMA-IDLE；独立软件夹具增加 SPI4、I2C1、ADC1、TIM3 CH1、EXTI0/1、IWDG1 与物理 Flash；基础装配为裸机／FreeRTOS；另有 V 修订 HSI64 裸机 SPI4 有限 DMA、USART3 连续双缓冲 RX，以及显式有限 TX DMA／连续 RX 双向模式（均 Cache off/on），以及 PLL384／Cache off 裸机时钟参考；可选独立 V／D-Cache off／AXI RGB565 DMA2D 组件"
msgstr "Cortex-M7F; 2 MiB Flash; 512 KiB AXI SRAM, with explicitly selected and initialized D2 SRAM1; pre-RAM LDO, HSI32/HSI64 with Cache off/on, TIM2, GPIO and USART3 IRQ/finite TX DMA/finite RX DMA-IDLE; independent software fixtures add SPI4, I2C1, ADC1, TIM3 CH1, EXTI0/1, IWDG1 and physical Flash; base assemblies use baremetal/FreeRTOS; separate V-revision HSI64 baremetal references provide finite SPI4 DMA, continuous double-buffer USART3 RX and explicitly selected finite TX-DMA/continuous RX duplex, all with Cache off/on, with separate PLL384/Cache-off baremetal clock references; an optional independent V/D-Cache-off/AXI RGB565 DMA2D component"

# Reviewed bounded-scope prose correction; unchanged messages retained.
msgid "PCB／供电／硅片 revision／Cache 一致性未观察；有限 RX 有 service/rearm 间隙，连续 RX 有界 inactive-bank 替换时限与显式 loss/stop；新增 UART/SPI DMA 模式只接纳所选 AXI SRAM，不接纳 PLL384 或 FreeRTOS；Cache on 要求独占完整 32-byte lines；无其他已选 DMA 引擎或运行状态接管；DMA2D 无 TOML/factory 路由；Flash 仅 Cache off；软件资格按精确源码独立记录"
msgstr "PCB, power, silicon revision and Cache coherence remain unobserved; finite RX has service/rearm gaps, while continuous RX has a bounded inactive-bank replacement deadline and explicit loss/stop; the new UART/SPI DMA modes accept only selected AXI SRAM, excluding PLL384 and FreeRTOS; Cache on requires exclusive complete 32-byte lines; no other selected DMA engine or running-state adoption; DMA2D has no TOML/factory route; Flash remains Cache off; software qualification is recorded against its exact source"

# Reviewed bounded-scope prose correction; unchanged messages retained.
msgid "Cortex-M33F；2 MiB Flash；SRAM1 192 KiB；外部预先确认 TZEN=0／SWAP_BANK=0，MSIS4 MHz、TIM2；GPIOA..H、USART1/2 IRQ bytes、IWDG；USART1 另可显式选择有限 GPDMA TX、有限硬件链 TX 或有界 FIFO IRQ bytes；独立软件夹具增加 SPI1、I2C1、ADC4、TIM3 CH1、EXTI0/1、物理 Flash、无引脚 LPTIM2 RUN 单次计数及预备 LSE RTC AlarmA RUN 轮询；基础装配为裸机／FreeRTOS，新增模式按各自精确配置验收"
msgstr "Cortex-M33F; 2 MiB Flash; 192 KiB SRAM1; externally established TZEN=0/SWAP_BANK=0, MSIS4 MHz and TIM2; GPIOA..H, USART1/2 IRQ bytes and IWDG; USART1 separately selects finite GPDMA TX, finite hardware-chain TX or bounded FIFO IRQ bytes; independent software fixtures add SPI1, I2C1, ADC4, TIM3 CH1, EXTI0/1, physical Flash, a pinless LPTIM2 RUN one-shot counter and prepared-LSE RTC AlarmA RUN polling; base assemblies use baremetal/FreeRTOS, with each new mode admitted against its exact configuration"

# Reviewed bounded-scope prose correction; unchanged messages retained.
msgid "PCB／SMPS／silicon revision／option bytes／VDDIO2 未测量；Cache off；ADC 要求外部准备 VDDA/ASV；USART1 GPDMA 仅有限连续地址 SRAM1 TX，RX 保持 IRQ bytes；硬件链最多三块、两私有节点，不开放通用 SG／循环链；LPTIM2/RTC 仅裸机 RUN；RTC backup domain 由外部 boot owner 预备；无 RX DMA、LPDMA、自主低功耗、Stop/VBAT 连续性、通用双域 factory 或其他 RAM 放置"
msgstr "PCB, SMPS, silicon revision, option bytes and VDDIO2 remain unmeasured; Cache off; ADC requires externally prepared VDDA/ASV; USART1 GPDMA supports only finite contiguous SRAM1 TX and retains IRQ-byte RX; hardware chains have at most three blocks and two private nodes, without general SG or cyclic chains; LPTIM2/RTC are baremetal RUN only; an external boot owner prepares the RTC backup domain; no RX DMA, LPDMA, autonomous low power, Stop/VBAT continuity, generic dual-domain factory or other RAM placement"

msgid "internal PHY PIO、EP0 control IN/OUT64、EP1–3 bulk IN/OUT MPS8/16/32/64 B、interrupt IN MPS1–64 B、packet loan、SETUP epoch、reset/stop drain、独立 48 MHz owner；非零 endpoint 配置／reset 后重新启用待接入；没有 Host/HS/DMA/ISO/class stack"
msgstr "Internal-PHY PIO, EP0 control IN/OUT64, EP1–3 bulk IN/OUT MPS8/16/32/64 B and interrupt IN MPS1–64 B, packet loans, SETUP epochs, reset/stop drain and an independent 48 MHz owner; nonzero endpoint configuration/reactivation after reset remains to be integrated; no Host/HS/DMA/ISO/class stack"
